-- title:
--   True zero stop canonical payment residual plus inclusive cash is nonpositive
-- statement:
--   On the zero-stopping event of the original infinite-activity Levy dividend problem, each genuine canonical-grid payment-only residual combined with exact inclusive Iic cash is nonpositive. It is the actual original zero-clock terminal-plus-cash bound plus the zero-duration physical Stieltjes correction, with time-zero payment atom preserved.

import Mathlib
